# Applies to `docker build -f server/Dockerfile .` (repo root context).
#
# The Dockerfile no longer copies application code from the local build
# context at all — server/entrypoint.sh clones/updates it fresh from git
# on every container start instead (see CLAUDE.md's Deployment section).
# So only the two files actually COPY'd at build time need to survive this
# ignore list: the baked-in model weight and the entrypoint script itself.
# Everything else is excluded to keep the build context small (this repo's
# server/.venv/ alone is ~12 GB, client/ is 754 MB).
*
!DA3METRIC-LARGE.onnx
!server/entrypoint.sh
